# Primary CTA

Single source in `site/src/styles/film-identity.css`: `.film-cta` / `.send-button`
(`--cta-bg` / `--cta-fg`).

## Rule

- Primary actions are **black filled buttons** (white label), hover invert.
- Use class `film-cta` or `send-button` (aliases already wired for home paths, project CTA, awards toggle).
- Do **not** use underline text / ghost text links as primary CTAs.

## Exceptions

- Secondary actions (e.g. contact email beside Submit) may stay outlined.
- Cookie / legal chrome may differ.
